  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "Ensure the Canvas particle system is rendered on a fixed background canvas behind all DOM elements, with mouse repulsion and subtle connection lines.",
    "Implement Framer Motion scroll-triggered reveals with staggered child delays across all section titles, bento cards, and project items.",
    "Strictly follow JavaScript (.js/.jsx) React syntax (do not use TypeScript .tsx files).",
    "Add data-testid attributes to all buttons, links, inputs, and interactive cards for seamless automated testing.",
    "Use Sonner toast notifications when users copy email or submit the contact form.",
    "Ensure dark mode is default (`dark` class on root html/body) with a smooth light mode toggle.",
    "Ensure high contrast APCA standards for all text over particle and glowing gradient surfaces."
  ],
  "UNIVERSAL GUIDELINES FOR MAIN AGENT": [
    "Dark colors look good when used independently without gradients. DO NOT use dark colors as gradients",
    "Don't make generic centered layouts, simplistic gradients, and uniform styling.",
    "Create depth through layered design elements with z-index hierarchy",
    "Use glass-morphism effects with backdrop filters (12-24px blur)",
    "You MUST NOT apply universal transition. Eg: transition: all. This results in breaking transforms. Always add transitions for specific interactive elements like button, input excluding transforms",
    "You MUST NOT center align the app container, ie do not add .App { text-align: center; } in the css file.",
    "Always use modern button styles like pill-shaped, or sharp button with interaction animations & color relevant to the app style",
    "NEVER: use AI assistant Emoji characters like 🤖🧠💭💡🔮🎯 etc for icons. Use lucide-react icons.",
    "Every interaction needs micro-animations - hover states, transitions, parallax effects, and entrance animations.",
    "Use 2-3x more spacing than feels comfortable.",
    "Subtle grain textures, noise overlays, custom cursors, selection states, and loading animations: separates good from extraordinary.",
    "All interactive and key informational elements MUST include data-testid attribute."
  ]
}